{
  "$comment": "External assets. `npm run assets:sync` downloads everything that has a resolvable source and records sha256 + license in manifest.lock.json. Freesound entries start with id=null: run `npm run assets:search -- \"<query>\"` to find CC0 candidates, then paste the chosen id here.",
